1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:13,000
AI-edited product media is everywhere. But buyers usually cannot tell where an image came from, who changed it, what changed, or whether its history was tampered with.

2
00:00:13,000 --> 00:00:28,000
AI Evidence Engine verifies recorded evidence instead of guessing an AI percentage. It checks the hash, digital signature, C2PA manifests, Registry record, and version chain.

3
00:00:28,000 --> 00:00:46,000
The ProofCart image is Modified. Its overlay and pixel-derived mask show the changed product-label region: 4.8% of the image, not a copyright percentage.

4
00:00:46,000 --> 00:01:27,000
Every substantive edit creates a child version. Each version keeps its Event ID, parent, hash, signature, timestamp, and embedded C2PA provenance. The development certificate proves integrity, not official Trust List identity.

5
00:01:27,000 --> 00:01:44,000
This prepared file changes the signed bytes. The verifier reports Invalid Signature while preserving the original evidence history.

6
00:01:44,000 --> 00:02:05,000
Gemini on Vertex AI explains verified facts in plain language. It never decides the trust state, and cryptographic verification still works if Gemini is unavailable.

7
00:02:05,000 --> 00:02:19,000
ProofCart lets a merchant attach verifiable history to a product photo so a buyer can inspect the source, edits, changed region, C2PA evidence, and signature.

8
00:02:19,000 --> 00:02:24,000
AI Evidence Engine records what happened. It does not make copyright, infringement, or legal verdicts. Evidence, not guesswork.
